# Precomputed visualization data (issue #7): built in CI, published as the
# `data` release asset, and delivered into files/iwac-visualizations/ by the
# admin "Pull latest data" job — never committed. Static map geometry lives in
# asset/geo/ (committed). Exceptions: scary-terms-events.json is the
# hand-curated historical-event annotation list for the Scary Terms trends
# view (issue #2), and laicite-events.json is the same pattern for the
# Laïcité block (issue #14). Both ride into the CI archive from the
# checkout instead of being generated.
/asset/data/*
!/asset/data/scary-terms-events.json
!/asset/data/laicite-events.json
